the printf statement.\n2. Ensure executable bit is recorded in Git via `git add --chmod=+x hello.sh`.\n3. Do **not** add tests, CI config, argument parsing, or any other files.\n\n## Verification\n```bash\ntest -x hello.sh\nhead -1 hello.sh | diff -u - <(printf '#!/usr/bin/env bash\\n')\n./hello.sh | diff -u - <(printf 'Hello, World!\\n')\n./hello.sh >/dev/null; test \"$?\" -eq 0\nstderr=\"$(./hello.sh 2>&1 >/dev/null)\"; test -z \"$stderr\"\ngit ls-files -s hello.sh | grep -Eq '^100755 '\n```\n\n---\n","numLines":50,"startLine":1,"totalLines":50}}}
